{"id":"lab-tracker-4qco.2","title":"Specify the minimal class-versus-concept contract","description":"Write the decision-complete public application profile that separates structural classes from controlled concepts and qualified relationships. This is the semantic contract for subsequent exporter work, not an internal model redesign.

