{"id":"lab-tracker-4qco.3","title":"Emit core classes and controlled-concept IRIs in JSON-LD","description":"Implement the approved application profile across standard provenance and ARA JSON-LD builders after the vocabulary contract and class-versus-concept specification are complete.

